@startuml seq-network-loss
' Courier loses network mid-delivery; resynchronises on return

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #555555
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #fafafa
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #bbbbbb
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #fffde7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #d0d0d0
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam defaultFontSize 10

title Network loss and resync\n(ADR 0005: batched idempotent POST — V1; full offline mode: V2)

participant "Courier App\n(IndexedDB queue)" as App
participant "gateway" as GW
participant "tracking" as Tracking

autonumber

== Online — normal position reporting ==

App -> GW : POST /positions {point, reportedAt, key=k1}
GW -> Tracking : forward
Tracking --> App : 200 OK

App -> GW : POST /positions {point, reportedAt, key=k2}
GW -> Tracking : forward
Tracking --> App : 200 OK

== Network lost ==

note over App
  Network lost.
  App detects connection failure.
  Positions continue to be queued locally
  in IndexedDB with generated idempotency keys.
  (Full offline mode — COU-06 — is V2.)
end note

App -> App : queue {point, key=k3}
App -> App : queue {point, key=k4}
App -> App : queue {point, key=k5}

... (offline — courier keeps moving) ...

== Network returns ==

note over App, GW : Network restored

App -> GW : POST /positions/batch\n[{point, key=k3}, {point, key=k4}, {point, key=k5}]
GW -> Tracking : forward batch
activate Tracking
Tracking -> Tracking : k3: new → store
Tracking -> Tracking : k4: new → store
Tracking -> Tracking : k5: new → store
Tracking --> App : 200 OK {accepted: [k3, k4, k5]}
deactivate Tracking
App -> App : clear queue

== Duplicate batch (retry) ==

note over App : Connection reset before 200 OK was received;\napp retries the same batch.

App -> GW : POST /positions/batch\n[{point, key=k3}, {point, key=k4}, {point, key=k5}]
GW -> Tracking : forward batch
activate Tracking
Tracking -> Tracking : k3: already exists → skip
Tracking -> Tracking : k4: already exists → skip
Tracking -> Tracking : k5: already exists → skip
Tracking --> App : 200 OK {accepted: []}
deactivate Tracking

note right of Tracking
  Idempotency: duplicate positions
  with the same key are silently dropped.
  No duplicate rows; no error returned.
  (ADR 0004 — idempotent consumers)
end note
@enduml
